{"resourceIdentifier":"4347","resourceName":"Hunan Anfu PP Recycling Project","description":"“Hunan Anfu PP Recycling Project” (hereafter referred to as “the project”) aims to produce PP flakes by recycling and processing post-consumer PP daily necessities (such as tubs, buckets, woven bags,etc.) to replace the same amount of PP products produced from raw materials. It is planned that 90,000 tons of post-consumer PP daily necessities per year will be recycled into 65,000 tons of PP flakes at maximum production capacity. The project located in Linli County, Changde City, Hunan Province, China and is developed and operated by Hunan Anfu Environmental Protection Technology Co., Ltd.(hereafter referred to as “the project proponent”). Prior to the project implementation, the same amount of PP flakes was produced from raw materials (crude oil and natural gas); the baseline scenario is the same as the condition prior to project initiation. The Project achieves GHG emission reductions by avoiding the consumption of the equivalent raw materials and by reducing related energy consumption as well. The first crediting period of the project is from 10-November-2021 to 09-November-2028. The estimated annual average GHG emission reductions are 42,918 tCO2e and the total estimated GHG emission reductions over the first crediting period are 300,427 tCO2e.","location":{"latitude":29.481040,"longitude":111.644290},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-05-05","endExclusive":"2023-06-05","endInclusive":"2023-06-04"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4347"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Hunan"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Hunan Anfu Environmental Protection Technology Co.,Ltd"},{"type":"string","value":"Hunan Province, China"},{"type":"string","value":"86-18942088038"},{"type":"stri